@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@token = PASTE_YOUR_TOKEN_HERE

### 1. Get my wallet
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallet
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 2. Deposit bani
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallet/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 5000
}

###

### 3. Get transaction history
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallet/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### 4. Get transactions cu paginare
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallet/transactions?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### ============ ERROR CASES ============

### 5. Deposit suma negativa (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallet/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": -100
}

###

### 6. Deposit peste limita (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/wallet/deposit
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 999999
}

###

### 7. Fara token (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/wallet

###